rredact includes PII regex rules adapted from OpenRedact / nerwhal:

  https://github.com/openredact/nerwhal
  https://gitlab.opencode.de/bmbf/datenlabor/openredact

OpenRedact and nerwhal are distributed under the MIT License. The adapted
rules are in defaults/openredact.yaml and cover email addresses,
German/international phone numbers, dates, addresses, IBANs and payment card
numbers. The statistical NER components are not included.

OpenRedact copyright: the OpenRedact / nerwhal contributors.
